    turnFlow: "1. Players take turns playing one card to a central pile and announcing the new cumulative total.\n2. After playing, the player draws one card from the deck.\n3. **Basic Cards**: Numbers 2-9 (excluding 4 and 5) add their face value.\n4. **Special Cards**:\n   - **Aces**: Add 1 or 11 (player choice).\n   - **4s**: Direction of play reverses (adds 0).\n   - **5s**: Subtracts 10 from the total.\n   - **10s**: Sets the total to exactly 100 (or adds 0 if already at 100).\n   - **Face Cards (J, Q, K)**: Add 10.\n   - **9s**: The 'Monkey' or 'Safe' card - adds 0.",
